<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Terms of Service | SchoolSync</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/common.css">
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        * { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        .gradient-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4F46E5 0%, #7C3AED 60%, #A855F7 100%); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-700">
    <header class="gradient-bg text-white py-10 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium opacity-90 hover:opacity-100">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to home
            </a>
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mt-4">Terms of Service</h1>
            <p class="mt-2 text-white/80 text-sm">Last updated: June 2026</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-10 space-y-8">
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">By accessing or using SchoolSync, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If your school has registered on SchoolSync, these terms apply to all users accessing the platform under that school's account, including Super Admins, School Admins, Teachers, Students, Parents, Librarians, and Drivers.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Account Responsibilities</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Users are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of their login credentials and for all activity that occurs under their account. School Admins are responsible for managing roles and access permissions within their school.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Subscriptions and Payments</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">SchoolSync is offered under subscription plans (Trial, Basic, Standard, and Premium). Fees are billed in advance and processed securely via Razorpay. Failure to renew a subscription may result in restricted access to platform features until payment is completed.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Acceptable Use</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-1">
                <li>Users must not attempt to access data outside their assigned role or school.</li>
                <li>Users must not upload unlawful, abusive, or infringing content.</li>
                <li>Automated scraping or unauthorized API access is prohibited.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">5. Data Ownership</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Each school retains ownership of its academic, administrative, and student data. SchoolSync acts as a service provider and processor of this data on behalf of the school.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">6. Termination</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms. Schools may request export of their data prior to account closure.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">SchoolSync is provided "as is". We are not liable for indirect or incidental damages arising from use of the platform, to the extent permitted by applicable law.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">8. Contact</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">For questions about these Terms, please visit our <a href="/support" class="text-indigo-600 font-medium hover:underline">Support</a> page.</p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="text-center text-xs text-slate-400 py-8">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> SchoolSync. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
